# Runtime dependencies. Server archetype policy: no new runtime dependency without a
# recorded reason (dependencies skill). Each reason is stated below.
#
# fastapi  : boundary validation. Every request body is parsed and rejected by a typed
#            model before a handler runs, which is the validate-at-the-boundary standard
#            rather than hand-rolled checks. Named framework in the Python deploy recipe.
# uvicorn  : the ASGI worker class the deploy recipe's gunicorn command loads.
# gunicorn : the process manager in the deploy recipe CMD, so SIGTERM reaches the app.
fastapi
uvicorn
gunicorn
